                                שלב 2: data-structures.scm (טיפוסים)
                            </button>
                            <button onclick="showRecipeStep(3)" id="btn-recipe-3"
                                class="w-full text-right px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold transition-all border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 cursor-pointer">
                                שלב 3: environments.scm (סביבות)
                            </button>
                            <button onclick="showRecipeStep(4)" id="btn-recipe-4"
